 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "호텔 예약 (I'd like a room)",
   "en": "Booking a hotel (I'd like a room)"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "호텔에서는 I'd like a room, please.로 부탁하고, I have a reservation.으로 예약을 말합니다. 기간은 for + 숫자 + nights로 말합니다. 시각은 check-in과 check-out으로 알려 줍니다.",
   "en": "At a hotel ask I'd like a room, please and say I have a reservation. Give the length of stay with for + number + nights. Check-in and check-out are the times to arrive and leave."
  },
